+
+                {%- comment -%}
+                  SpiritHaus blocks. Added as new `when` branches rather than by
+                  restructuring this section, so the file stays mergeable with
+                  upstream Dawn. Order is set in templates/product.json.
+                {%- endcomment -%}
+
