+                    Build the rows first so the <dl> is only emitted when at
+                    least one metafield on this product actually has a value.
+                  {%- endcomment -%}
+                  {%- capture spec_rows -%}
+                    {%- comment -%}
+                      Standard drinks leads the table: it is the figure
+                      Australian customers look for, and it is regulated under
+                      the Food Standards Code. It is read from a metafield, never
+                      computed from volume x ABV — the bottle label is the source
+                      of truth, and a derived number that disagrees with it is a
